imary objective was to find and retrieve the [[Ring of Arc]]. The mission was completed successfully and was then continued into the next mission, [[Joan of Arc's Ring]].\n\n== Objectives ==\n* Find where the secret entrance to the [[Paris Catacombs]] was located.\n* Explore the underground tombs.\n* Return with the [[Ring of Arc|Joan of Arc's Ring]].\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Missions|Mystery of the Paris Catacombs]]","categories":["Article stubs","Huntik Foundation Missions"],"links":[{"target_title":"Paris, France","label":"Paris, France","target_id":"huntik:page:9034","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Paris%2C_France","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Paris%2C%20France"},{"target_title":"Paris Catacombs","label":"Paris Catacombs","target_id":"huntik:page:4972","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Paris_Catacombs","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4972"},{"target_title":"Paris Catacombs","label":"Paris Catacombs","target_id":"huntik:page:4972","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Paris_Catacombs","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A4972"},{"target_title":"Ring of Arc","label":"Joan of Arc's Ring","target_id":"huntik:page:2543","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Ring_of_Arc","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2543"},{"target_title":"Dante Vale","label":"Dante Vale","target_id":"huntik:page:2006","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Dante_Vale","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2006"},{"target_title":"Lok Lambert","label":"Lok Lambert","target_id":"huntik:page:1983","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Lok_Lambert","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1983"},{"target_title":"Sophie Casterwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhal